# .env.example — committed template; copy to .env and fill in real values.
# .env is gitignored (.env* rule in configs/.gitignore); .env.example is not.
# Never commit secrets to version control.

# blastimage currently requires no environment variables. State is stored in
# browser localStorage and there is no hosted mode to configure.
#
# Future hosted persistence should keep server-side Neon/R2 credentials outside
# the client bundle and expose them through a server/edge boundary.
